    "name": "EventHub API",
    "description": "Postman collection for EventHub multi-tenant notification system.\n\nSuggested run order:\n1) Auth -> Register or Login\n2) Apps -> Create App\n3) Apps -> Generate API Key\n4) Templates -> Create Template\n5) Events -> Publish Event\n6) Events/Deliveries/Analytics -> Read results",
